          This folder contains the following directories:

          Folder Name               Description

          <BTI1553>     MIL-STD-1553 Driver Examples
          <BTI422>      RS-422 Driver Examples
          <BTI429>      ARINC 429 Driver Examples
          <BTI708>      ARINC 708 Driver Examples
          <BTI717>      ARINC 717 Driver Examples
          <BTICard>     Card Level Driver Examples
          <BTICSDB>     CSDB Driver Examples
          <BTIDIO>      Discrete IO Driver Examples
          <BTIEBR>      EBR-1553 Driver Examples

          README        This document

          Refer to the end of this document for corrections,
          warnings, and additional information.



     INTRODUCTION

          The folders listed above contain the various
          protocols supported by the universal BTIDriver API.
          In the folder for each protocol are several example
          programs.  See the README in each folder for a full
          description of these example programs.

          For multi-protocol BTIDriver compliant products,
          simply combine the concepts from the included
          example programs to build your own custom
          application.



     CORRECTIONS, WARNINGS, AND ADDITIONAL INFORMATION

          There is no additional information.


